 "disagreements_summary": [
  "Vashya matrix: five published tables (classical symmetric, onlinejyotish, astroyogi with 1.5s, PyJHora/vedikastrologer, Maitreya/Saravali).",
  "Yoni matrix: software family (Saravali/aadri/thevedichoroscope/PyJHora) vs Maitreya8 vs Hindi-panchang tables; inside the software family only Horse-Deer and Buffalo-Lion differ.",
  "Gana: identical numbers but two orientations; Prokerala output supports boy-Rakshasa x girl-Deva = 1.",
  "Varna: Saravali/PyJHora swap Vaishya and Shudra signs; AstroSage output supports the fire/earth/air/water = K/V/S/B mapping.",
  "Graha Maitri: Maitreya8 uses 2/2/1 for NN/FE/NE; mainstream uses 3/1/0.5 (AstroSage output confirms NN = 3).",
  "Tara: PyJHora's current code is inverted; everyone else marks remainders 3/5/7 as bad.",
  "Manglik: 2nd house included or not; reference points Lagna/Moon/Venus; cancellation lists vary widely.",
  "Nadi exemption nakshatra lists differ between AstroSage and Narada Samhita."
 ],
